1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,220
If you could fly,

2
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:02,345
going fast would hurt.

3
00:00:02,365 --> 00:00:04,565
At 100 km/h,

4
00:00:04,585 --> 00:00:05,551
it's like sticking your head

5
00:00:05,551 --> 00:00:06,354
out of a car on

6
00:00:06,354 --> 00:00:07,351
the highway.

7
00:00:07,371 --> 00:00:08,181
At 200 km/h,

8
00:00:08,201 --> 00:00:09,391
skydiver speed,

9
00:00:09,411 --> 00:00:10,720
the wind hits so hard

10
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,909
your eyes won't stop watering.

11
00:00:12,929 --> 00:00:14,116
Fliers, get goggles.

12
00:00:15,467 --> 00:00:16,692
Then a peregrine falcon

13
00:00:16,692 --> 00:00:17,647
overtakes you.

14
00:00:17,667 --> 00:00:18,377
In a dive,

15
00:00:18,397 --> 00:00:21,325
falcons can top 300 km/h.

16
00:00:21,345 --> 00:00:21,844
Rude.

17
00:00:23,195 --> 00:00:24,243
Want more speed?

18
00:00:24,263 --> 00:00:26,245
Strike the superhero pose.

19
00:00:26,265 --> 00:00:28,002
Less drag, more speed.

20
00:00:28,022 --> 00:00:28,994
The cape is optional.

21
00:00:30,344 --> 00:00:31,546
Now take a tight turn

22
00:00:31,546 --> 00:00:33,434
at 300 km/h,

23
00:00:33,454 --> 00:00:34,460
on a curve a hundred

24
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:35,644
meters across.

25
00:00:35,664 --> 00:00:36,831
That squeezes you with around

26
00:00:36,831 --> 00:00:37,434
seven g,

27
00:00:37,454 --> 00:00:39,067
seven times your body weight.

28
00:00:39,087 --> 00:00:41,137
Without training or a g-suit,

29
00:00:41,157 --> 00:00:42,319
many people black out

30
00:00:42,319 --> 00:00:44,390
somewhere between four and six g.

31
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:45,987
First your vision goes gray.

32
00:00:46,007 --> 00:00:47,616
Then black.

33
00:00:47,636 --> 00:00:49,063
Subscribe for more what ifs!
